L["Fangs for the Memories \226\128\148 the one-time seasonal quest that awards the Corrosive Victory toy. Live tracking starts once its quest ID is confirmed."] = "Fangs for the Memories — 授予 Corrosive Victory 玩具的一次性赛季任务。任务 ID 确认后才会开始实时追踪。"
