L["How a cooldown's time-left maps to its spot on the lane. Linear spaces time evenly; Timeline and Logarithmic compress long timers so near-ready cooldowns spread out; Split places icons using your own time-to-position points below."] = "冷却的剩余时间如何映射到轨道上的位置。「线性」按时间均匀分布。「时间轴」和「对数」会压缩长计时，让接近就绪的冷却拉开距离。「分段」则按你在下方自定义的时间-位置节点放置图标。"
L["How Cooldown Master tells you about a new version: a Popup window, a quiet clickable Chat link in your chat, or Off. Reopen the notes any time with /cm whatsnew."] = "Cooldown Master 通知新版本的方式：「弹窗」、聊天框中一条安静的可点击「聊天链接」，或「关闭」。随时输入 /cm whatsnew 可重新查看更新说明。"
L["How long the timer runs after the trigger fires. Type an exact value in the box below the slider."] = "触发后计时持续多久。可在滑块下方的输入框中填写精确数值。"
L["How quest, achievement and endeavor titles are colored. Failed quests are always red, and finished ones green unless Use title color for completed quests is on."] = "任务、成就、活动标题的着色方式。失败的任务始终为红色，已完成的任务为绿色，除非开启“已完成任务使用标题文字颜色”。"
L["How this one behaves once it pops into a ready box.\n\nNormal - fades after the box's Display Duration.\n\nImportant - highlights the icon and holds it for the box's Highlight Duration instead, and plays the box's Highlight Sound (set to None until you pick one).\n\nPinned - the icon never fades. It stays until you reload or switch profile, and a box full of pinned icons has no room for new pops.\n\nImp + Pin - both."] = "此冷却弹入就绪框后的行为。\n\n普通：在该框的「显示时长」后淡出。\n\n重要：高亮该图标并改为保持该框的「高亮时长」，同时播放该框的「高亮音效」（在你选择之前为「无」）。\n\n固定：图标永不淡出。它会一直保留，直到你重载界面或切换配置文件，而被固定图标占满的框将没有空间容纳新的弹出。\n\n重要+固定：两者兼有。"
L["Instead of green."] = "替换绿色显示。"
