L["These settings apply to every spell in the chosen category. To override an individual spell, use that category's sub-tab on the left."] = "这些设置适用于所选分类中的每个法术。要单独覆盖某个法术，请使用左侧该分类的子标签页。"
L["This category stays empty on this version of the game.\nIt lists Blizzard's own bar-style tracked buffs, which exist only on retail. The harmful effects you put on a target are under Offensives."] = "此分类在当前版本的游戏中保持为空。\n它列出的是暴雪自带的条状追踪增益，仅存在于正式服。你施加在目标身上的有害效果请见「攻击效果」。"
L["This frame lets go of a cooldown once it has this many seconds left, so a lane can take it the rest of the way. 0 keeps every cooldown on the bar until it is ready.\n\nThis only decides when the BAR lets go. What decides when the lane picks up is that lane's own Max Time and Hide Long Timers, so set this to the lane's Max Time and make sure Hide Long Timers is on for it. Without that the lane draws the cooldown the whole time, parked at the far end, instead of waiting its turn.\n\nA value above the lane's Max Time leaves a stretch where neither one draws it. It applies to everything routed to this frame, not only to long cooldowns."] = "当冷却只剩下这么多秒时，此框体就会放手，让轨道接手剩下的路程。设为 0 则每个冷却都留在计时条上，直到就绪。\n\n这只决定计时条何时放手。决定轨道何时接手的，是该轨道自己的最大时间（秒）和隐藏超长计时。因此请把此值设为轨道的最大时间，并确认该轨道已开启隐藏超长计时。否则轨道会全程显示这个冷却，停在最远端，而不是等到该它的时候。\n\n高于轨道最大时间的值会留下一段两者都不显示的空档。该设置作用于所有被指派到此框体的内容，而不只是长冷却。"
L["This tab is not yet implemented in v%s."] = "此标签页在 v%s 中尚未实现。"
L["Three of the six unlock from the quest \"%s\"."] = "六种中有三种通过任务 \"%s\" 解锁。"
L["Tip: enable Unlock Frames on the Global tab, then drag this box into position."] = "提示：在「全局」标签页启用「解锁框体」，然后把此框拖到合适位置。"
L["Tip: right-click the minimap button to jump to Options. For support, the author may ask you to run a debug command."] = "提示：右键点击小地图按钮可直接跳到设置。为了协助排查问题，作者可能会请你运行某个调试命令。"
L["Tip: turn on Unlock Frames (Global tab) to drag this frame, and Test (Global tab) to preview bars."] = "提示：开启「解锁框体」（全局标签页）以拖动此框体，开启「测试」（全局标签页）以预览计时条。"
L["Turns all six category filters back on and clears the current-zone filter. Nothing else on this tab is changed."] = "重新开启全部6项分类筛选，清除当前区域筛选。本标签页其余选项保持不变。"
L["Type:"] = "类型："
L["Unknown category: %s"] = "未知分类：%s"
L["Untick to stop tracking this whole category. None of its cooldowns show on a lane or a bar, or pop a ready frame. This is the same setting as Enabled on the Defaults tab."] = "取消勾选以停止追踪整个分类。其中的冷却都不会显示在轨道或计时条上，也不会弹出就绪框。此项与「默认值」标签页中的「启用」是同一个设置。"
L["Untick to stop tracking this whole category. None of its cooldowns will show on a lane or pop a ready frame."] = "取消勾选以停止追踪整个分类。其中的冷却都不会显示在轨道上，也不会弹出就绪框。"
L["Updated"] = "更新"
L["Use class color for titles"] = "任务标题使用职业颜色"
L["Visual emphasis drawn on icons flagged Important (per spell, in Filters). Border outlines the icon; Glow and Flash pulse it; Border + Flash does both; None disables it."] = "为标记了「重要」的图标绘制的视觉强调（在过滤器中按法术设置）。「边框」为图标描边。「发光」和「闪烁」使其脉动。「边框 + 闪烁」两者兼有。「无」则禁用。"
L["What's New in %s"] = "%s 更新内容"
L["When cleared, falls back to difficulty coloring or default yellow."] = "清空后将使用任务难度颜色或默认黄色。"
L["Which bar frame this category's cooldowns appear in. The chosen Bars frame must also be enabled on the Bars tab. Off shows no bar."] = "此分类的冷却显示在哪个计时条框体中。所选的计时条框体还必须在「计时条框体」标签页中启用。「关闭」则不显示计时条。"
L["Which lane this category's cooldowns travel along. The chosen lane must also be enabled on the Lanes tab - one marked (off) draws nothing."] = "此分类的冷却沿哪条轨道移动。所选轨道还必须在「轨道」标签页中启用，标记为（关闭）的轨道不会绘制任何内容。"
L["Which lane this cooldown travels in. Default follows this category's Default Lane, set on the Defaults tab."] = "此冷却在哪条轨道上移动。「默认」跟随该分类在「默认值」标签页中设置的「默认轨道」。"
L["While inside a delve, tracks the two bonus-chest objectives - Nemesis Strongbox packs and the Sanctified Banner - so you know you've grabbed the extra loot before pulling the boss."] = "在地下堡中追踪两个额外宝箱目标 - 死敌保险箱的怪物组和 Sanctified Banner - 让你在开首领之前确认额外战利品都已到手。"
